<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan 1996 inflation slows to 15.1 pct.</title>
<headline>Moldovan 1996 inflation slows to 15.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moldova's consumer price inflation slowed to 15.1 percent in 1996 from 23.8 percent in 1995, a National Bank official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    MOLDOVAN CONSUMER PRICES     Dec '96    Nov '96    Dec '95</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change		+0.8	 +1.4	 +2.9</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change	+15.1	+17.0	+23.8</p>
<p>The bank expects inflation to slow further to 10-13 percent this year. It was 105 percent in 1994 and over 2000 percent in 1993.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
